        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Michigan Investors</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;No more than 10% of any one Michigan investor&#8217;s liquid net worth shall be invested in this offering of securities. </font>
