        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Massachusetts Investors</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Purchasers residing in Massachusetts must limit their aggregate investment in us and other illiquid direct participation programs to not more than 10% of their liquid net worth. </font>
