          </div>
          <div style=" margin-top:7.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Yes. We have used leverage and expect to continue to use leverage to finance our investments and for working capital and other corporate purposes. </font>
          </div>
          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
          <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">On March&#160;15, 2023, we entered into a $35&#160;million credit facility, or the Sunflower Secured Credit Facility, pursuant to a Secured Revolving Loan Credit Agreement, by and among SWIF II Investment Co. Towers II, LLC (f/k/a SWIF II Investment Co. II, LLC), a wholly-owned subsidiary of our Operating Partnership, or Investment Co. II, SWIF II Investment Co. Data Center, LLC, an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of our operating partnership, or SWIF II Data Center, SWIF II Investment Co. </font>
