          <div style=" margin-top:6.2pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">This is a &#8220;best efforts&#8221; offering and if we are unable to raise substantial funds, then we will be more limited in our investments. </font>
