          </div>
          <div style=" line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">a quarterly statement providing material information regarding your participation in the distribution reinvestment plan and an annual statement providing tax information with respect to income earned on shares under the distribution reinvestment plan for the calendar year. </font>
          </div>
          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
          <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Depending on legal requirements, we may post this information on our website, www.digitalinfrastructurereit.com, the contents of which are not incorporated by reference herein, or provide this information to you via U.S. mail or other courier, electronic delivery, or some combination of the foregoing. Information about us will also be available on the SEC&#8217;s website at www.sec.gov. </font>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Our monthly NAV per share for each class will be posted on our website promptly after it has become available. </font>
          </div>
          <div style=" float:left; line-height:12pt; margin-top:8.09pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:bold;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Q:</font>
