        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Increases in interest rates could increase the amount of our debt payments and adversely affect our ability to pay distributions to our stockholders.</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
