        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">a full operational and financial analysis to identify the key risks and opportunities of the asset or assets, including among other things, a detailed review of historical and projected financial results, engineering analyses, viability analyses, environmental analyses, FAA and FCC regulatory analyses and legal analyses of agreements affecting said asset or assets and rights associated therewith; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
