        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Our charter places numerous limitations on us with respect to the manner in which we may invest our funds or issue securities. In addition to the policies discussed above, pursuant to our charter, we will not, among other restrictions: </font>
        </div>
