        <div style=" margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Asset owned indirectly through our 51% ownership interest in the DataCom Joint Venture. </font>
