        <div style=" margin-top:5.7pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">upon 60&#160;days&#8217; written notice with &#8220;good reason&#8221; by the advisor; or </font>
