        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The advisory agreement may be terminated without cause or penalty by us (upon approval of a majority of independent directors) or our advisor upon 60&#160;days&#8217; written notice. Furthermore, we may immediately terminate the advisory agreement &#8220;for cause&#8221; or upon our advisor&#8217;s bankruptcy. &#8220;Cause&#8221; is defined in the advisory agreement to mean fraud, criminal conduct, misconduct or negligent breach of fiduciary duty by our advisor or a material breach of the advisory agreement by our advisor. </font>
