          <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">For the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2024, as compared to the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2023, the decrease in net cash used in investing activities was primarily due to a $26,124,865 decrease in cash paid to acquire real estate investments and a reduction in our capital contributions of $8,623,810 in our investment in the DataCom Joint Venture. </font>
          </div>

        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Financing Activities </font>
        </div>
