        <div style=" margin-top:9.19pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">In 2019, our sponsor acquired Strategic Data Center Fund, LLC (f/k/a CV Data Growth &amp; Income REIT, LLC) from an unaffiliated party. Our dealer manager, however, served as the dealer manager of the fund since its launch date.</font>
        </div>
