          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:7.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:60pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">both (A)&#160;the requirements of clause (b)&#160;are satisfied when they are applied by substituting &#8220;20%&#8221; for &#8220;10%&#8221; and (B)(1) the aggregate adjusted bases of all such property sold during the 3 taxable year period ending with such taxable year divided by (2)&#160;the sum of the aggregate adjusted bases of all of the assets of the REIT as of the beginning of each of the 3 taxable&#160;years, does not exceed 10%; or </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:40pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:7.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">(e)</font>
