        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:7.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:60pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">both (A)&#160;the requirements of clause (c)&#160;are satisfied when they are applied by substituting 20% for 10% and (B)(1) the fair market value of all such property sold during the 3 taxable year period ending with such taxable year divided by (2)&#160;the sum of the fair market value of all of the assets of the trust as of the beginning of each of the 3 taxable&#160;years, does not exceed 10%; </font>
        </div>
