        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Certain income, gain, loss, and deductions of SWIF II OP for US federal income tax purposes will be allocated to each limited partnership unit, regardless of whether any distributions are made by SWIF II OP. </font>
