        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Series&#160;A Preferred Shares</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;The Series&#160;A preferred shares rank senior to all classes or series of common shares and to any other shares issued by the Company with respect to dividend and redemption rights and rights upon liquidation, dissolution, or winding-up of the Company. The Company may redeem shares of the Series&#160;A preferred shares at its own option at any time for cash at a redemption price per share equal to $1,000, plus all accrued and unpaid dividends thereon, plus a redemption premium of $50 per share if the date of the redemption is on or before December&#160;31, 2023. The holders of the Series&#160;A preferred shares are not entitled to vote on any matter, except as it relates to authorization or issuance of any equity security senior to, or on parity with, the Series&#160;A preferred shares and any amendment to the Charter. On February&#160;28, 2023, the Company redeemed all Series&#160;A Preferred shares. </font>
