        <div style=" margin-top:7.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:40pt;">
          <font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Suitability.</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Each Participant agrees that if such Participant fails to meet the then current suitability requirements for making an investment in the Company or cannot make the other representations or warranties as set forth in the Company&#8217;s most recent applicable prospectus or subscription agreement, enrollment form or other authorization form, such Participant will promptly so notify the Company in writing. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:7.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
