        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">We consider stockholder privacy to be fundamental to our relationship with our stockholders. In the course of servicing your account, we collect personal information about you (&#8220;Nonpublic Personal Information&#8221;). We are committed to maintaining the confidentiality, integrity, and security of our stockholders&#8217; personal information. It is our policy to respect the privacy of our current and former stockholders and to protect the personal information entrusted to us. This privacy policy (this &#8220;Privacy Policy&#8221;) describes the standards we follow for handling your personal information and how we use the information we collect about you. </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:12pt; margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
